{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":24,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"ffebb985-633b-4c47-924d-d847425b21bf","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270904510,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"针织设计师","OrgId":0,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责品牌毛衫、T恤、针织套装等品类的独立开发工作。基于对未来年轻消费者审美与生活方式的洞察，完成设计全流程工作，并确保设计创意的高度还原与完美落地。\n2、依托深入的工艺与版型知识，确保设计作品不仅具有艺术美感，更具备商业化的可行性与出色的穿着体验。能通过工艺创新打造产品的差异化竞争力。\n3、协同项目组（如商品、营销团队） 进行系列主题的头脑风暴与开发方向共创，确保产品线与品牌整体战略和市场需求同频。\n4、定期进行市场巡店与调研，深入一线直接观察并分析目标客群的穿着偏好、消费行为及市场反馈，使设计工作始终以用户为中心。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，拥有5年以上知名品牌针织产品独立设计开发经验，并具备从企划到落地的全流程项目管理能力。\n2、对针织纱线、肌理、织法（针型）、廓形有深刻的理解和实战经验，能独立绘制精准的工艺版单，并有效指导版房或供应商完成打样。\n3、精通 Adobe Illustrator、Photoshop 等设计软件，能高效完成设计稿、花型及工艺图的绘制。\n4、对时尚趋势和年轻消费群体的喜好有敏锐的洞察力，具备强烈的商业意识和数据敏感度，能通过市场反馈驱动设计优化。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-02T09:29:41","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddr