源的挖掘与业务突破；\n2、实地考察项目现场，与甲方负责人深入洽谈合作意向，全面调研周边品牌分布与竞争态势，精准把握项目落位策略，确保公司品牌在所在楼层的领先优势；\n3、系统推进重点渠道的合作关系维护与深化，统筹管理与第三方商业机构的战略协作，拓展多元化合作机会；\n4、主导重点渠道项目的商务谈判，负责合作条件的协商与优化，并高效完成合同的续签与管理，保障合作持续稳定推进。","Require":"1、全日制专科及以上，市场营销、工商管理等相关专业优先；\n2、具备8年以上品牌服装行业渠道相关工作经验；5年以上一线商场体系拓展或招商经验 ；\n3、目标感强、抗压能力强、具有高自驱力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-04T16:44:55","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"1c6c20fe-2fee-4a09-9c7d-5b5bee3745bc","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270409951,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"视觉创意经理/高级经理","OrgId":1597897,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责视觉策略的制定，带领团队进行商业化视觉作品的创意设计；\n2、组织并监督创意作品完成，确保美术和文字的构成符合策略及创意标准；\n3、参与重点品牌推广项⽬的构思与创意设计，提供优秀的视觉解决⽅案；\n4、理解顾客及产品需求，基于对设计趋势的分析和思考带领设计团队，不断优化顾客的视觉体验；\n5、搭建并完善设计素材库，参与公司品牌VI与相关视觉体系的规范建设；\n6、 负责视觉运维成本计划的订制并监督计划的执行；\n7、通过工作指导、工作分配、绩效管理、项目管理、团队交流等，不断提升团队专业能⼒和知识沉淀。\n\n","Require":"1、全日制本科及以上学历，视觉穿搭设计/美术相关专业；\n2、8年以上品牌公司/广告公司视觉创意管理相关工作经验，具备扎实的美术功底和艺术修养，熟悉广告行业相关知识；\n3、具备良好的视觉创意表现能力（色彩搭配、质感表现、排版布局、字体设计、文案构思等）及良好的创意文案写作能力；\n4、具备敏锐的市场洞察力以及流行时尚的捕捉能力，善于激励、培训、指导团队（设计和文案）提升工作效率、保证团队工作产出及产出质量；\n5、熟练操作Photoshop、Illustrator、3D等相关设计软件，具备良好的沟通表达及团队协作能力。\n6、具有国际知名服装行业同行业工作经历或者国际时尚行业工作背景者优先考虑；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2021-12-06T14:41:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null}],"Total":0}